														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1475917">
									

<p>The actual serious subtext to this parody is that I do not like when AWCY is used as a skeleton that pops out, especially when it is done to hold together an otherwise flimsy idea or, on the other hand, undermines an otherwise fantastic idea.</p>
<p>Take a random ACWY entry, replace the AWCY reveal with some variation of &quot;and a skeleton pops out&quot; and try to be scared or interested. Heck, take any other SCP and do that. I think it ruins the piece.</p>

